{% liquid
assign form_id = 'CraftInquiry-' | append: section.id
assign machine_names = 'LZ-T5 Fiber Laser Marking Machine,LZ-RF CO2 Laser Marking Machine,LZ-UV UV Laser Marking Machine,LZ-1390 CO2 Laser Cutting Machine,LZ-1325 CNC Router' | split: ','
%}
<div class="dd-craft"><section class="dd-craft__hero"><div class="dd-craft__wrap"><nav class="dd-craft__crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}#HomeIndustries">Industries</a><span>/</span><span>Crafts &amp; Personalized Gifts</span></nav><div class="dd-craft__split"><div><p class="dd-craft__eyebrow">CRAFTS &amp; PERSONALIZED GIFTS</p><h1>Laser Marking &amp; Cutting for Crafts and Personalized Gifts</h1><p class="dd-craft__lead">Turn names, artwork and custom designs into personalized products. Compare marking for metal and non-metal gifts with cutting for acrylic and wooden craft components.</p><div class="dd-craft__actions"><a class="dd-craft__button" href="#CraftContact">Request a Free Sample Test</a><a href="#CraftSamples">Explore Sample Applications →</a></div><p class="dd-craft__note">Material-based selection · Sample testing · Training &amp; technical support</p></div><figure><img src="{{ 'craft-sample-pens.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="Personalized metal pens with engraved lettering" width="440" height="330" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" class="craft-hero-image"><figcaption>Personalized gift sample. Match the material and finish before choosing equipment.</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>
<section class="dd-craft__section" id="CraftSamples"><div class="dd-craft__wrap"><div class="craft-intro"><h2>Metal gifts: names, logos and decorative details</h2><p>Explore fiber laser marking for suitable metal gifts and accessories. Confirm the metal, surface finish and marking area with a sample test. Curved items may require a rotary attachment or fixture.</p></div><div class="craft-samples"><figure><img src="{{ 'craft-sample-bracelet.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="Personalized metal bracelet" width="440" height="330" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Personalized metal bracelet</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="{{ 'craft-sample-keyrings.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="Logo-marked promotional keyrings" width="440" height="330" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Logo-marked promotional keyrings</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="{{ 'craft-sample-mug.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="Decorated metal gift mug" width="440" height="330" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Decorated metal gift mug</figcaption></figure></div><div class="craft-equipment"><a class="dd-craft__button" href="{{ routes.root_url }}products/lz-t5-desktop-fiber-laser-marking-machine">Explore LZ-T5 Fiber Marking</a></div></div></section>
<section class="dd-craft__section" id="CraftCO2"><div class="dd-craft__wrap"><div class="craft-intro"><h2>CO2 marking for non-metal crafts</h2><p>Wood and bamboo gifts, leather details and stone keepsakes offer different marking effects. The LZ-RF series offers 30W–60W configurations; selection depends on the material and required result.</p></div><div class="craft-samples"><figure><img src="{{ 'craft-co2-bamboo.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="Engraved bamboo gift board" width="440" height="330" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Engraved bamboo gift board</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="{{ 'craft-co2-leather.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="Logo-marked leather sample" width="440" height="330" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Logo-marked leather sample</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="{{ 'craft-co2-slate.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="Personalized slate coasters" width="440" height="330" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Personalized slate coasters</figcaption></figure></div><div class="craft-equipment"><a class="dd-craft__button" href="{{ routes.root_url }}products/lz-rf-35w-co2-laser-marking-machine">Explore LZ-RF CO2 Marking</a></div></div></section>
<section class="dd-craft__section" id="CraftUV"><div class="dd-craft__wrap"><div class="craft-intro"><h2>UV marking across metal and non-metal products</h2><p>For businesses handling a mix of gift materials, evaluate UV marking on plastics, glass, stainless steel, wood and leather. A sample test confirms the finish on each material rather than assuming one setting suits every item.</p></div><div class="craft-samples"><figure><img src="{{ 'craft-uv-tags.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="UV-marked colored tags" width="440" height="330" loading="lazy"><figcaption>UV-marked colored tags</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="{{ 'craft-uv-glass.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="Personalized glass bottle" width="440" height="330" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Personalized glass bottle</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="{{ 'craft-uv-metal.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="Logo marked on a metal plate" width="440" height="330" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Logo marked on a metal plate</figcaption></figure></div><div class="craft-equipment"><a class="dd-craft__button" href="{{ routes.root_url }}products/lz-uv-laser-marking-machine">Explore LZ-UV Marking</a></div></div></section>
<section class="dd-craft__section" id="CraftCutting"><div class="dd-craft__wrap"><div class="craft-intro"><h2>Cut components for acrylic and wooden crafts</h2><p>Use CO2 cutting for suitable acrylic and wood-based sheet parts. These examples show a finished illuminated acrylic decoration and unassembled wooden panels. Lighting bases, assembly and finishing are separate production steps.</p></div><div class="craft-samples"><figure><img src="{{ 'laser-sample-acrylic-lamp.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="Illuminated acrylic craft with separate light base" width="440" height="330" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Illuminated acrylic craft with separate light base</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="{{ 'laser-sample-wood-dice-panels.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="Cut wooden dice panels before assembly" width="440" height="330" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Cut wooden dice panels before assembly</figcaption></figure></div><div class="craft-equipment"><a class="dd-craft__button" href="{{ routes.root_url }}products/lz-1390-industrial-co2-laser-cutting-machine">Explore LZ-1390 CO2 Cutting</a></div></div></section>
<section class="dd-craft__section dd-craft__tint" id="CraftMachine"><div class="dd-craft__wrap dd-craft__split"><div><h2>Choose the process around your finished product</h2><p>Share the material, surface coating, artwork, dimensions and production volume. We review the marking or cutting process and the required workholding before recommending a configuration.</p><p>For routed wooden shapes and decorative panels, also explore <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/industry-furniture">CNC woodworking applications</a>. For printed display components, see <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}pages/industry-display">display production solutions</a>.</p><a class="dd-craft__button" href="#CraftContact">Get a Craft Production Solution</a></div><ol class="dd-craft__steps"><li><h3>01 · Review your product</h3><p>Confirm material, artwork and desired appearance.</p></li><li><h3>02 · Test the process</h3><p>Review a sample before choosing the machine and accessories.</p></li><li><h3>03 · Confirm the proposal</h3><p>Agree configuration, quotation and order-specific delivery timing.</p></li><li><h3>04 · Prepare for production</h3><p>English manuals, videos, remote training, equipment-specific spare parts and technical support. On-site support can be arranged.</p></li></ol></div></section>
<section class="dd-craft__section"><div class="dd-craft__wrap"><div class="dd-craft__faq"><h2>Craft production questions</h2><details><summary>Which laser should I choose for personalized gifts?</summary><p>Start with the exact material and desired finish. Fiber marking is a candidate for metal gifts; CO2 marking for suitable non-metal materials; UV marking for a wider mix of metal and non-metal items. Test your actual product before confirming the configuration.</p></details><details><summary>Can UV marking be used beyond plastics?</summary><p>Yes. Applications can include wood, leather, plastics, glass and stainless steel. The achievable contrast and finish depend on the material, coating, artwork and settings; send a sample for evaluation.</p></details><details><summary>Can a marking machine cut my craft shapes?</summary><p>Marking and profile cutting are different processes. For suitable acrylic or wood-based sheet components, discuss a CO2 cutting machine. CNC routing is another option for shaped wooden components and decorative machining.</p></details><details><summary>Do cups, rings and curved items need accessories?</summary><p>A rotary attachment or dedicated fixture may be needed, depending on the shape and marking area. We confirm compatibility and include the required options in the proposal; they are not assumed to be standard.</p></details><details><summary>What should I send for a free sample test?</summary><p>Send material composition, coating details, dimensions, artwork, the finish you want and expected production volume. We confirm test arrangements before selecting equipment. Sample shipping, if needed, is agreed separately.</p></details></div></div></section>
  <section class="dd-craft__section" id="CraftContact"><div class="dd-craft__wrap dd-craft__split"><div><p class="dd-craft__eyebrow">TELL US WHAT YOU WANT TO MAKE</p><h2>Get an equipment proposal for your craft and gift business</h2><p>Share your material, thickness, finished size and production requirements. We will help you plan the equipment and a free sample test.</p><p><a href="mailto:info@gzcnc-laser.com">info@gzcnc-laser.com</a><br><a href="https://wa.me/8618988946615">WhatsApp: +86 189 8894 6615</a></p><p class="dd-craft__note">Need to share artwork or photos? Send them by email or WhatsApp. Name, email and message are required.</p></div>
    {% form 'contact', id: form_id %}
      <input type="hidden" name="contact[Source]" value="Crafts and personalized gifts industry page">
      {% if form.posted_successfully? %}<div class="dd-craft__success" role="status" tabindex="-1" data-craft-success><strong>Thank you — your inquiry has been sent.</strong><p>Our team will review your requirements and contact you by email. You do not need to submit the same inquiry again.</p></div><dialog data-craft-dialog aria-labelledby="CraftSuccessTitle"><h2 id="CraftSuccessTitle">Inquiry sent successfully</h2><p>Thank you for contacting Dragon Diamond. Our team will review your requirements and contact you by email.</p><button type="button" class="dd-craft__button" data-craft-close>Got it</button></dialog>{% endif %}
      {% if form.errors %}<div role="alert">{{ form.errors | default_errors }}</div>{% endif %}
      <div class="dd-craft__fields"><div><label for="SignName-{{ section.id }}">Name *</label><input id="SignName-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[name]" autocomplete="name" value="{{ form.name | escape }}" required></div><div><label for="SignEmail-{{ section.id }}">Email *</label><input id="SignEmail-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[email]" type="email" autocomplete="email" value="{{ form.email | escape }}" required></div><div><label for="SignCompany-{{ section.id }}">Company</label><input id="SignCompany-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[Company]" autocomplete="organization" value="{{ form.Company | escape }}"></div><div><label for="SignWA-{{ section.id }}">WhatsApp</label><input id="SignWA-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[WhatsApp]" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" value="{{ form.WhatsApp | escape }}"></div></div>
      <label for="SignProduct-{{ section.id }}">Product Interested</label><select id="SignProduct-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[Product Interested]"><option>Crafts equipment / need advice</option>{% for name in machine_names %}<option>{{ name }}</option>{% endfor %}<option>Other craft production equipment</option></select>
      <label for="SignMessage-{{ section.id }}">Message *</label><textarea id="SignMessage-{{ section.id }}" name="contact[body]" rows="5" placeholder="Material, thickness, finished size, production needs and destination country..." required>{{ form.body | escape }}</textarea><button type="submit" class="dd-craft__button">Send Inquiry</button>
    {% endform %}
  </div></section></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":{{ request.origin | append: routes.root_url | json }}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Crafts & Personalized Gifts","item":{{ canonical_url | json }}}]}</script>{% stylesheet %}
.dd-craft{color:#163237;background:#fff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.65}.dd-craft *{box-sizing:border-box}.dd-craft__wrap{max-width:1280px;margin:auto;padding:0 32px}.dd-craft__section{padding:76px 0}.dd-craft__tint{background:#eff5f4}.dd-craft__hero{background:#14373b;color:#fff;padding:135px 0 64px}.dd-craft__crumb{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:44px}.dd-craft .dd-craft__hero a{color:#80e0d7}.dd-craft__split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px;align-items:start}.dd-craft__hero .dd-craft__split{align-items:center}.dd-craft h1,.dd-craft h2,.dd-craft h3{font-family:var(--font-heading--family,Arial,sans-serif);color:inherit;letter-spacing:-.025em;line-height:1.16;margin:0 0 20px}.dd-craft h1{font-size:clamp(36px,3.4vw,54px)}.dd-craft h2{font-size:clamp(28px,2.6vw,38px)}.dd-craft h3{font-size:23px;margin-bottom:14px}.dd-craft p{margin:0 0 20px}.dd-craft__eyebrow{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;color:#087d83}.dd-craft__hero .dd-craft__eyebrow{color:#80e0d7}.dd-craft__lead{font-size:19px}.dd-craft__intro{max-width:800px}.dd-craft__actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:28px 0}.dd-craft a{color:#08777b;text-underline-offset:4px}.dd-craft__button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:48px;padding:13px 20px;background:#087c80;color:#fff!important;border:0;border-radius:4px;font:700 15px/1.4 Arial,sans-serif;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;text-align:center}.dd-craft__hero .dd-craft__button{background:#74dfd3;color:#10383b!important}.dd-craft figure{margin:0}.dd-craft img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}.dd-craft__hero img{aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:10px}.dd-craft figcaption,.dd-craft__note{font-size:14px;margin-top:18px!important}.dd-craft__hero figcaption{color:#c4dcde}.dd-craft__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:24px;margin-top:30px}.dd-craft__two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:26px;margin-top:30px}.dd-craft__card{border:1px solid #d6e2e2;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.dd-craft__card img{aspect-ratio:16/10;object-fit:cover}.dd-craft__body{padding:24px;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.dd-craft__body>a:last-child{margin-top:auto}.dd-craft__body ul{padding-left:20px;margin:0 0 24px;font-size:15px}.dd-craft__machine>a{background:#e8f0ef}.dd-craft__machine img{object-fit:contain;padding:18px;aspect-ratio:4/3}.dd-craft__panel{padding:26px;background:#fff;border-radius:8px;border-top:3px solid #087f82}.dd-craft__panel p{margin:0}.dd-craft__steps{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;border-left:2px solid #83c9c5}.dd-craft__steps li{padding:0 0 20px 26px}.dd-craft__steps li:last-child{padding-bottom:0}.dd-craft__steps h3{font-size:21px}.dd-craft__faq details{border-bottom:1px solid #b9cecc}.dd-craft__faq summary{padding:18px 0;min-height:48px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}.dd-craft__faq details p{padding:0 0 16px}.dd-craft__fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 18px}.dd-craft label{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700}.dd-craft input,.dd-craft textarea,.dd-craft select{display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;min-height:48px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #a8c0c0;border-radius:4px;background:#fff;color:#163237;font:16px/1.4 Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:18px}.dd-craft textarea{resize:vertical}.dd-craft [id]{scroll-margin-top:125px}.dd-craft :focus-visible{outline:3px solid #d18b24;outline-offset:4px}.dd-craft__success{padding:20px;background:#e0f5ee;border:2px solid #087c80;margin-bottom:24px;border-radius:6px}.dd-craft dialog{max-width:520px;width:calc(100% - 32px);padding:30px;border:0;border-radius:10px;color:#163237}.dd-craft dialog::backdrop{background:#082429b3}.dd-craft__two img{object-fit:contain;background:#edf3f2}.dd-craft a{overflow-wrap:anywhere}@media(max-width:899px){.dd-craft__wrap{padding:0 22px}.dd-craft__split{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px}.dd-craft__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.dd-craft__section{padding:48px 0}.dd-craft__hero{padding-top:105px}.dd-craft__crumb{margin-bottom:28px}.dd-craft__hero img{aspect-ratio:16/10}.dd-craft__machine img{max-height:310px}.dd-craft__two{grid-template-columns:1fr}.dd-craft__body{padding:22px}.dd-craft__actions{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.dd-craft__fields{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.dd-craft .craft-samples{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px}.dd-craft .craft-samples figure{margin:0;background:white;border:1px solid #dce5e5;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}.dd-craft .craft-samples img{width:100%;height:220px;object-fit:contain;background:#fff}.dd-craft .craft-samples figcaption{padding:12px 16px}.dd-craft .craft-hero-image{aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:contain;background:white}.dd-craft .craft-intro{max-width:850px;margin-bottom:24px}.dd-craft .craft-equipment{margin-top:22px}@media(max-width:700px){.dd-craft .craft-samples{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.dd-craft .craft-samples img{height:155px}.dd-craft .craft-samples figcaption{font-size:14px;padding:10px}.dd-craft .craft-samples figure:last-child:nth-child(odd){grid-column:1/-1}.dd-craft .craft-samples figure:last-child:nth-child(odd) img{height:190px}}{% endstylesheet %}
{% javascript %}
function initCraftFeedback(){document.querySelectorAll('[data-craft-dialog]').forEach(dialog=>{if(dialog.dataset.ready)return;dialog.dataset.ready='true';const status=dialog.closest('form').querySelector('[data-craft-success]');dialog.querySelector('[data-craft-close]').addEventListener('click',()=>dialog.close());dialog.addEventListener('close',()=>status.focus());if(typeof dialog.showModal==='function')dialog.showModal();else status.focus();});}
initCraftFeedback();document.addEventListener('shopify:section:load',initCraftFeedback);
{% endjavascript %}
